		{
			description: [
				"The default is &6M &rto open the map. Press &6T &rto teleport to the location pointed to by the mouse. Click the globe icon in the bottom left corner to change dimensions."
				""
				"You can claim and load blocks in the top left corner of the interface (claimed blocks can be explosion-proof). If you are on a server, set the forced loading mode &6&rin the server settings (purple gear) of the ftb chunk to &balways &r, which allows the server to load force loaded blocks even if no one is online."
				""
				"Press and hold the &6~ &rkeys to activate the chain"
				""
				"In the upper right corner of the task interface, click the third button from the top to view the shortcut keys in the task interface."
				""
				"Type /sethome \"name\" to set the teleportation point, type /home \"corresponding name\" to teleport to the corresponding teleportation point"
				""
				"The file backup can be found in the backup folder of the game's root directory. Type /backup start to perform a backup immediately."
				""
				"Flight inertia is disabled by default and can be changed in the gtlcore configuration file"
				""
				"If the GregTech version does not match when online, make sure the configuration files on the server and client are consistent."
				""
				"More tips can be found in the &d&rTips and Tricks chapter group"
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "ftbquests:book"
			id: "4F864738509B6DCA"
			rewards: [{
				id: "723CCD5BBA07EEDA"
				item: "gtceu:copper_credit"
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
