		{
			description: [
				"A casual-focused GregTech onboarding package (casual is less difficult than other Graytech packages)"
				""
				"Main process"
				"Steam &8ULV &r: Collect basic resources, larger and more powerful steam engines, ironworks, and ultra-dimensional earth forges."
				"Low voltage &7LV &r: basic electrical machine, electric blast furnace."
				"Medium Voltage &bMV &r: Silicon Crystal, Petroleum Processing, Upgraded Machine."
				"High voltage &6HV &r: processor, large chemical reactor, first stage rocket to the moon, distillation tower, titanium."
				"Ultra-high voltage &5EV &r: Nanoprocessor, empty mining machine, second, third and fourth stage rocket, tungsten, platinum series metals."
				"Strong Pressure Guide &9IV &r: Quantum processor, alloy smelting furnace, fission reactor, fifth stage rocket, large machine, assembly line, database."
				"Dramatic differential pressure &dLuV &r: crystal processor, silica, sixth stage rocket, MK1 nuclear fusion, computer."
				"Zero point pressure &cZPM &r: wetware processor, MK2 nuclear fusion, seventh stage rocket."
				"Extreme Pressure &3UV &r: Biologically active processor, MK3 nuclear fusion, deep chemical twister, circuit assembly line, space elevator."
				"Extremely high pressure &4UHV &r: optical processor, MK4 nuclear fusion, star forge, super silica bomb, super reactor."
				"Extreme Overpressure &aUEV &r: Strange Processor, Fusion MK5, Supercritical Synthesis, Bedrock Processing, Adamantite."
				"Extreme pressure &2UIV &r: Universal processor, cosmic detection, mass generator, quarks, superheavy elements."
				"Extremely High Pressure &eUXV &r: Super Causal Processor, Dragon, Cosmic Neutron, Infinity, Ultra-Dimensional Plasma Forge, X-Side."
				"Overload voltage &1OpV &r: Hyper-time and space circuit, simulation of universe, time and space, singularity, eternity."
				"Upper limit pressure &cMAX &r: Create item crafting."
				"Additional question &cM &r&aA &r&9X &r&e+ &r: The fish is big."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
