			]
			description: [
				"Wareless mode is very useful, but remember to right-click and open the GUI every time you enter the file, otherwise it will have no effect."
				""
				"Coil level detection on advanced terminals is not very sensitive"
				""
				"The number of repeating structures is suitable for multi-block structures that can be stacked in multiple layers, such as distillation towers. Simply put, the higher the number, the longer the structure."
			]
			id: "1A124E85453923DF"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
