		}
		{
			description: [
				"This is bad news, you have come to a fragmented world,"
				"This world is not complete, it has become fragments."
				"But I left you some goodies that will help you continue your journey."
				"Save them, &l&d&oThey are all necessary!!! &r&r&r"
				""
				"Necessary Tips:"
				"What is that! Sky island mode!"
				"Only if you selected &bSky Island &rwhen creating the world"
				"This task can be performed"
				"You need to click on the &b&rmodule in the game menu interface."
				"Search &bgtlcore &r, click &bto configure &r,"
				"Change island mode setting &b&rfrom &bfalse &rto &btrue &r"
				"After completing the above steps, &6restart the &rgame. The configuration content does not support hot reloading."
				"This is how you really get into island mode. If you want to try normal mode, just go back to normal mode and create a new save file."
				"See the next page for the sky island version server setup process."
				""
				"{ image:ftbquests:textures/picture/002.png width:320 height:200 align:center }"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"If you want to open an island version of the server"
				"you need to modify"
				""
				"In config/gtlcore.yaml"
				"enableSkyBlokeMode changed to true"
				""
				"in server.properties"
				"Change the level type to skyblockbuilder\\:skyblock"
				""
				"And I suggest you take a look at the skyblock builder wiki"
				"wiki.chaotictrials.de/docs/wiki/skyblock-builder/"
				"to learn about the relevant instructions"
			]
			icon: "gtlcore:world_fragments_overworld"
			id: "0F4AFDE98CEA87B1"
			min_width: 350
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "0AFB0CC841A156B2"
				item: "gtlcore:world_fragments_overworld"
				type: "item"
			}]
