		{
			dependencies: [
				"1A124E85453923DF"
				"027197A71E630966"
			]
			description: [
				"Based on the advanced terminal, &bis compatible with the replacement of &rcoil, space elevator power module, component assembly line shell and stellar thermal container (click the \"Level Block\" text with the mouse to open the level block selection interface)"
				""
				"It also supports &bmirror positioning and &rmulti-block structure. Tubeless mode will remain in effect and you will even be able to put fluids in (identify the bucket of fluid on your body, the bucket of whales in the ocean, and the fluid in the ME network)"
				""
				"It also supports linking from &bto AE &r, extracting materials directly from the ME lattice to build a multi-block structure (stealthy right-click to link any component in the ME lattice; direct cross dimension is not supported and the same ME lattice component needs to exist in both dimensions)"
				""
				"It also supports one-click disassembly of the &d&rmulti-block structure (activating AE mode will directly return to the ME network. When not turning it on, it is recommended to carry a backpack and other containers; only AE mode can recycle fluid)"
			]
			id: "3F8DDC1B589F52AC"
